<title>NETHERLANDS: Vendex sees Vedior listing in June.</title>
<headline>Vendex sees Vedior listing in June.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Retail and business services group Vendex International NV said on Monday it planned to list its services spin-off company Vedior NV on the Amsterdam and London stock exchanges in June.</p>
<p>Vendex in April said it planned to place and list shares worth 600 million guilders in Vedior by an initial public offering in the middles of 1997.</p>
